Steps:
1. Authenticate as 'nonowner'. 2. Send a PUT request to /api/shops/1/workers/1 with the payload in testData. 3. Observe the response status and body.

Test Data: {
  "name": "Updated Worker",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "address": "789 Pine St"
}

